  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> , </span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">has released the pre Answer Key for the post of DEO, LDC. This recruitment was released for 64 posts. Applications for the Bihar Vidhan Parishad PA, DEO, LDC &amp; Stenographer Recruitment 2025 were accepted from <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">28 November 2025</span>, to <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">05 January 2026</span>. The examination was conducted on 10 May 2026. Candidates who had appeared in Pre Examination can download their Bihar Vidhan Parishad LDC/ DEO Pre Answer Key 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"google-anno-skip google-anno-sc\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"Police exam prep\" data-google-vignette=\"false\" data-google-interstitial=\"false\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bihar Vidhan Parishad (BVP), Government of Bihar</span></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Bihar Vidhan Parishad LDC/ DEO Pre Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt.No:02/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>28 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>05 January 2026 (Extend)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Online Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>07 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>05 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>30 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Phase-I Answer key : <strong>09 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Phase-I Result : <strong>28 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\">Phase-II Exam Date : </span><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\">02 May 2026 (PA, Steno)</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\">Phase-II Admit Card :</span><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\"> 29 April 2026 (PA, Steno)</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\">Exam Date :</span><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\">10 May 2026 (DEO, LDC)</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>06 May 2026 (DEO, LDC)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pre Answer Key : <strong>13 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">For All Candidates <strong>: Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BVP PA, DEO, LDC &amp; Stenographer Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 August 2025.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>18 Years (DEO / LDC)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>21 Years (Steno / PA)</strong></span></li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>37 Years (General/ EWS Male)</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>40 Years (General / EWS Female)</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>40 Years (BC/ EBC Male &amp; Female)</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>42 Years (SC / ST Male &amp; Female)</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per (BVP) PA, DEO, LDC &amp; Stenographer Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BVP PA, DEO, LDC &amp; Stenographer 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Posts : 64 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Personal Assistant (PA)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">07 Post</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Data Entry Operator (DEO)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">35 Post</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Lower Division Clerk (LDC)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">10 Post</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Stenographer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">12 Post</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Total</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>64 Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>BVP PA, DEO, LDC &amp; Stenographer Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.3388%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.6612%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.3388%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Personal Assistant (PA)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.6612%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">The candidate must be a graduate from a recognized university and should possess Hindi stenography skills with a speed of 100 words per minute. Additionally, a typing speed of 30 words per minute in both Hindi and English is required.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">A computer qualification from AICTE/DOEACC/NIELIT or an ‘O’ Level certificate is considered desirable.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.3388%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Data Entry Operator (DEO)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.6612%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">The candidate should have completed Intermediate (10+2) and must possess a typing speed of 8,000 key depressions per hour.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">A computer qualification such as ADCA or a certificate issued by AICTE/DOEACC/NIELIT (‘O’ Level) will be considered desirable.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.3388%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Lower Division Clerk (LDC)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.6612%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">The applicant should have passed Intermediate (10+2) and must possess a typing speed of 30 words per minute in Hindi or English.<br>\n</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">A computer certification from AICTE/DOEACC/NIELIT or an ‘O’ Level qualification is considered desirable.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.3388%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Stenographer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.6612%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">The applicant should be a graduate and must have Hindi stenography skills with a speed of 80 words per minute, along with a typing speed of 30 words per minute in Hindi or English.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">A computer qualification from AICTE/DOEACC/NIELIT or an ‘O’ Level certificate will be considered desirable.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download Bihar Vidhan Parishad PA, DEO, LDC &amp; Stenographer Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In order to download their Bihar Vidhan Parishad PA, DEO, LDC &amp; Stenographer Answer Key candidates need to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their Bihar Vidhan Parishad PA, DEO, LDC &amp; Stenographer Answer Key.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates will be redirected to Login Page, Here they have to provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Registration No. /Login ID/Roll No.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Password/DOB</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Verification Code(if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to download their Bihar Vidhan Parishad PA, DEO, LDC &amp; Stenographer Answer Key.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can also download their Answer Key from official site of the Bihar Vidhan Parishad.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BVP PA, DEO, LDC &amp; Stenographer Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Steno / Typing Test (Post Wise)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-